==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|recidīvus||lang=la|returning, recurring}} (compare {{term|recidivous}}) {{suffix||ism}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# Committing new [[offense]]s after being punished for a [[crime]].
#: ''The increase in criminal activity was attributed to [[recidivism]].''
# {{context|psychology|psychiatry|lang=en}} [[chronic|Chronic]] [[repetition]] of [[criminal]] or other [[antisocial]] behavior.

====Related terms====
* [[recidivate]]
* [[recidivist]]
* [[recidivistic]]
* [[recidivous]]

